Package: conflibertR
Title: ConfliBERT Inference for Conflict and Political Violence Text
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shreyas", "Meher", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(website = "http://shreyasmeher.com"))
Description: R interface to ConfliBERT, a pretrained language model for
    conflict and political violence text analysis. Provides functions for
    named entity recognition, binary classification, multilabel
    classification, and question answering. Models are loaded from
    HuggingFace via the Python transformers library through reticulate.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.0
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.34),
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
